    "parchment.mjolnir.hint1.vague": "Whenever I step on Ginger Island on a rainy day, I fell like there is something somewhere judging me.",
    "parchment.mjolnir.hint1.detailed": "Whenever it rains on Ginger Island, if I wander around a bit I always find a lying hammer. What can it do?",
    "parchment.mjolnir.hint2.vague": "I tried to lift this hammer, but couldn't. For some reason, I fell like I'm not worthy of it yet. Maybe I don't have good enough skills?",
