    "parchment.mjolnir.hint3.vague": "There is an old tale of hammer that belongs to the Thunder God. To awaken its ultimate power, one does not simply forge it with Galaxy Souls, but special Thunder Souls. But how one gets them is a tale lost in time. I only know that one should somehow force the lightning to struck the Galaxy Soul.",
    "parchment.mjolnir.hint3.detailed": "I lifted the hammer, but its powers are not enough. To awaken its ultimate power, you need special Thunder Souls that can be acquired only by forcing lightning to struck Galaxy Soul. I wonder if having lightning rod in my inventory may help?",
